    {
      "id": "east-thin-party",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 3900,
      "speaker": "Woman at the Cairn",
      "requires": [
        "#party<3"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "You came through that with what you've got? Sit down before you fall down.",
        "Listen to me. What's massing at the rivermouth is worse than what you just walked through, and it is worse by a long way.",
        "There's no shame in it. But go down there short-handed and the crossing is where you stop."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "I'll manage",
        "I'll take whoever will come"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "She looks at you a long moment and does not say what she is thinking.",
        "Then ask at the fires. There are people down there with nothing left to lose but the sitting still."
      ],
